                                                "sense_id": "6f7ab4f7-5870-3171-8d5a-59c8ac5eb6aa",
                                                "text": "Mountweazel, the encyclopedia indicates, was born in Bangs, Ohio, in 1942, only to die “at 31 in an explosion while on assignment for Combustibles magazine.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d587b19-8e5f-46ca-bdac-f018dbf07e76",
                                                "sense_id": "6f7ab4f7-5870-3171-8d5a-59c8ac5eb6aa",
                                                "text": "The vote was 213-209 along party lines. Republican members of the House Ethics Committee – Michael Guest of Mississippi, Dave Joyce of Ohio, Andrew Garbarino of New York, John Rutherford of Florida and Michelle Fischbach of Minnesota – voted present. GOP Rep. Ken Buck of Colorado also voted present but he is not on the Ethics Committee."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "345aff7f-cc6c-4488-a33b-69ef236a2855",
                                                "sense_id": "6f7ab4f7-5870-3171-8d5a-59c8ac5eb6aa",
                                                "text": "In the House, Reps. Josh Gottheimer, a New Jersey Democrat, Max Miller, an Ohio Republican, and Jared Moskowitz, a Florida Democrat, are also leading the effort."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b85f5ea-5392-3ea5-9bb2-f57b663587d0",
